---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Personal engineering log · 2025</div>
      <h1>你好，我是 <em>lilyeggy</em>。</h1>
      <p>我喜欢把复杂的问题拆开，做成可以运行、可以验证、也可以被别人看懂的东西。这里记录正在进行的项目和一路上的小进步。</p>
      <div class="hero-meta"><span class="status">currently building</span><span class="meta-divider"></span><span>agent infrastructure · systems · learning</span></div>
    </section>

    <section id="projects" class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-number">01</span><h2>PROJECTS</h2><span class="section-rule"></span><span class="section-note">things I am building</span>
    </section>

    <section class="project-grid">
      <a class="project-card featured" href="/projects/vram-aware-harness">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">⌘</span><span class="card-status">● active / core project</span><span class="card-index">01</span></div>
        <h3>VRAM-Aware <span>Agent Harness</span></h3>
        <p>一个支持团队共享本地大模型的多租户 Agent 任务服务。把可靠执行、GPU 调度、工具治理和真实隔离放进同一个用户闭环。</p>
        <div class="card-bottom"><div class="tech-list"><span>TypeScript</span><span>Pi</span><span>vLLM</span><span>SQLite</span></div><span class="card-link">open project →</span></div>
      </a>

      <a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/lilyeggy/VRAM-Aware-Harness/tree/main/agentic-rl-rollout-explorer" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">↗</span><span class="card-status">exploring</span><span class="card-index">02</span></div>
        <h3>Agentic RL<br /><span>Rollout Explorer</span></h3>
        <p>围绕 Agent rollout 的实验性探索，记录从执行过程到结果分析的思路和实现。</p>
        <div class="card-bottom"><div class="tech-list"><span>React</span><span>Next.js</span><span>Drizzle</span></div><span class="card-link">source ↗</span></div>
      </a>

      <a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/lilyeggy/VRAM-Aware-Harness/tree/main/ax-code-atlas" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">#</span><span class="card-status">in progress</span><span class="card-index">03</span></div>
        <h3>AX Code<br /><span>Atlas</span></h3>
        <p>用地图和可视化的方式整理代码、架构与关键路径，让大型工程更容易被理解和继续推进。</p>
        <div class="card-bottom"><div class="tech-list"><span>Code map</span><span>Atlas</span><span>Web</span></div><span class="card-link">source ↗</span></div>
      </a>

      <a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/lilyeggy/VRAM-Aware-Harness/tree/main/project-roadmap-atlas" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">↯</span><span class="card-status">planning</span><span class="card-index">04</span></div>
        <h3>Project<br /><span>Roadmap Atlas</span></h3>
        <p>多租户 Agent 任务服务的阶段技术地图，追踪交付物、完成证据、架构边界和下一步路线。</p>
        <div class="card-bottom"><div class="tech-list"><span>Roadmap</span><span>Docs</span><span>Atlas</span></div><span class="card-link">source ↗</span></div>
      </a>

      <a class="project-card" href="https://github.com/lilyeggy/VRAM-Aware-Harness/tree/main/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E5%AE%9E%E9%AA%8C" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-icon">⌁</span><span class="card-status">learning lab</span><span class="card-index">05</span></div>
        <h3>计算机基础<br /><span>实验场</span></h3>
        <p>从进程、pipe、async、socket 到 container，用真实的 Agent Infra 问题补齐系统基础。</p>
        <div class="card-bottom"><div class="tech-list"><span>Python</span><span>Linux</span><span>Docker</span></div><span class="card-link">source ↗</span></div>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section id="activity" class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-number">02</span><h2>ACTIVITY</h2><span class="section-rule"></span><span class="section-note">proof of work</span>
    </section>
    <section class="activity-card">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">GitHub contributions</div><h3>持续构建，持续记录。</h3><p>每一个方块，都是一次微小的推进。</p></div>
      <div class="activity-graph"><img src="https://ghchart.rshah.org/2f63da/lilyeggy" alt="lilyeggy's GitHub contribution graph" loading="lazy" /><div class="activity-caption"><span>less</span><span>more · lilyeggy</span></div></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
